		(property "Description" "Ultra-low-leakage load switch for the NFC tag rail. TPS22916C DSBGA-4 YFP (0.4 mm pitch, 0.5 max height -- the 2026-08-06 ultrathin swap; was TPS22919 SC-70-6, 1.1). C version = active-high ON, 150R QOD, slow inrush-limited ramp, reverse-current blocking. ISD 10 nA typ/100 nA max vs the 22919 2 nA typ -- +8 nA typ on the dominant OFF state, bought back 16x in ON-state IQ (0.5 uA vs 8 uA); ball map A1 VOUT, A2 VIN, B1 GND, B2 ON per SLVSDO5F Fig 5-2."
