		(property "Description" "10uF 25V 1206 X5R LOW-PROFILE (GRM319: 0.85 +/-0.10 -> 0.95 MAX), AEM VINT buffer (min 5uF EFFECTIVE). VINT sits at 2.2V = 9 pct of rating, derating ~nil: K-tol worst ~8.7uF effective. Re-picked 2026-08-06 off the height wall (was Samsung 0805 X7R, 1.40 max). X5R is DELIBERATE: no low-profile 10uF true-X7R exists in any case size (all 1.8mm+), and the supercaps already cap the system at +85C -- exactly X5R's window. 25V rating vs the incumbent 16V."
