		(property "Description" "10uF 25V 1206 X5R LOW-PROFILE (GRM319: 0.85 +/-0.10 -> 0.95 MAX), STO local bulk/decoupling. STO 5.5V max = 22 pct of rating -> ~8uF effective worst case, ABOVE the 16V 0805 X7R it replaces (5.5V was 34 pct of that rating). X5R deliberate -- see C26: the system is +85C-capped by the supercaps. Was one of the three 1.4mm-plus parts holding the enclosure height wall; 0.95 max drops the trio off it."
