		(property "Description" "NFC tank trim, 0603 High-Q C0G 250 V +/-2% (Johanson S-series QSCP, 0.89 max, legacy 251R14S470GV4T -- low-profile respin 2026-08-06, purpose-built RF part kept per DRH: the S-series has NO 1206 case and no maker stocks a flat RF 1206, so the same family one case DOWN. Was the 0805 QSCT, 1.17 max; the 2026-07-30 0402->0805 upsize fled 0402 rework, and 0603 is the board's workhorse hand case). PLACED at assembly as of 2026-07-30 - value derived, not trimmed: coil L = 0.958 uH by Greenhouse on the board's 7 rails, ferrite-loaded 1.05-1.30 uH, tag Ci = 50 pF (NT3H2211 Table 42), antenna Cc = 6 pF (AN11276 Table 2). 47 pF lands the enclosed resonance at 14.45 MHz against AN11276 4.2.1's 14.5 MHz single-tag target and stays above the 13.56 carrier across the whole ferrite range. Was 82 pF + DNP, which sat at 12.5 MHz enclosed - under the carrier, the wrong side to miss on."
			(at 560.07 119.38 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
