		(property "Description" "C9 tank trim pad, DNP (2026-08-07). Parallel with C9 across LA/LB: bench granularity for the paper-tune ladder, and headroom for the AIR variant retune -- the open 316L frame drops the ferrite, L falls toward the bare 0.958 uH, f0 rises, and the fix is MORE C in parallel: exactly what this pad adds. Fit a High-Q C0G 0402 chosen at the bench; stays out of every buy document until a value exists (dnp + exclude_from_bom + exclude_from_pos_files)."
