		(property "Description" "4x150R isolated ballast array replacing discrete R1-R4 (DRH consolidation 2026-08-07). Panasonic EXB-28V151JX: 0804 convex, elements pair pins 1-8/2-7/3-6/4-5 CONFIRMED from the catalog's printed pin diagram and matched by the board (every K opposite its documented LDRV -- a different pairing convention would permute the LED channels). AEC-Q200 Grade 1 in the CURRENT catalog; 0.45 max height (0.15 under the lite brace's 0.60 span); J +/-5% is the buyable ceiling in this land (the only F-grade, Yageo YC124-FR, is marketplace-only 10k MOQ; KOA CN1E4 EOL; four-LED matching rests on same-substrate construction). Runner-up: Yageo YC124-JR-07150RL (lost on withdrawn AEC claim + height margin). Land: KiCad R_Array_Convex_4x0402 with inner pads slimmed to 0.294 -- see PCB/README's re-link warning."
